Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] detect overdue home-owned scheduled and todo
 transitions

WIP checkpoint: hub-owned grouped observer, canonical park deadlines, parents-done clocks, conservative checkpoint custody and existing alarm filing/provenance. Initial focused suites pass. Remaining before ship: bounded sweep/freshness validation, full killing coverage and historical/live replica proof, independent review and CI.
